NOTE ON DATASETS

This license covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only. It does not cover
and cannot grant any rights in the datasets the code consumes. No dataset files
are distributed here, by design — each is governed by its own terms and must be
obtained from its original provider:

  HAD100 (and its baseline result matrices)
      Li, Wang, Xiao, Ling, Lin and An, IEEE TGRS 61, 2023,
      doi:10.1109/TGRS.2023.3258067 — https://zhaoxuli123.github.io/HAD100/
  ABU (Airport-Beach-Urban)
      Kang et al.; distributed by the authors
  Salinas
      AVIRIS / Purdue; distributed via the ehu.eus hyperspectral scene archive
  FLAME 3
      Hopkins et al., arXiv:2412.02831, doi:10.21227/w0mz-aq48 — IEEE DataPort
  ECOSTRESS Spectral Library v1.0
      Meerdink et al., RSE 230:111196, 2019 — https://speclib.jpl.nasa.gov/

`scripts/download_data.py` fetches what can be fetched and, for account-gated
sources, prints the provider's page and the exact path to place the file at.
Redistribution of any of these datasets is the provider's call, not ours.
